 "intro_zh": "金石滩是国家级风景名胜区、国家级旅游度假区、国家级地质公园。景区三面环海，冬暖夏凉，气候宜人。主要景点有黄金海岸、金石文化博览广场、滨海国家地质公园、金石缘公园、金石蜡像馆、发现王国等。",
 "intro_en": "Jinshitan is a national-level scenic spot, a national-level tourist resort, and a national-level geological park. The scenic spot is surrounded by the sea on three sides, with warm winters and cool summers, and a pleasant climate. The main attractions include Gold Coast, Jinshi Culture Expo Plaza, Binhai National Geopark, Jinshiyuan Park, Jinshi Paraffin Museum, Discovery Kingdom, etc.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
